/E (Farmer Producer Organisations \(FPOs\) bring farmers together to aggregate produce, purchase inputs collectively and access larger markets. However, many struggle to generate enough business to cover operating costs and deliver consistent value to their members. Establishing an FPO is therefore only the first step towards building a commercially viable organisation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
