/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 250 0 R
/E (Strategic Priorities: Identify two or three challenges that KAP should prioritise to improve FPO sustainability. Explain why addressing these constraints would have the greatest impact on business performance and independent operations. Distinguish between priorities common to all 12 FPOs and those requiring different approaches for maize- and vegetable-focused FPOs. A detailed assessment of individual FPOs is not required.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 251 0 R
/E (Priority Interventions and Expected Outcomes: Recommend up to three practical interventions to address the priorities identified above. Explain how KAP should implement each intervention and where the approach should differ between maize- and vegetable-focused FPOs. Define the expected outcomes by the end of the support period using a few measurable targets, such as farmer participation, business volumes or the ability to cover operating costs. Clearly state the assumptions supporting these targets.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
